 - Isolation merge strategy: `task.isolation.merge` selects patch mode (capture/apply root patches) or branch mode (commit to the hidden ref `refs/omp/task/<id>` — outside `refs/heads/` so colocated jj checkouts never import/abandon it — then cherry-pick into parent; the short name `omp/task/<id>` still resolves in every git command). `task.isolation.apply=false` retains captured changes without applying them; nested repositories get separate patch artifacts.
